(a)
Her Majesty in right of the Province;

(b)
the Minister;

(c)
a municipality;

(d)
a rural community;

(e)
the fire department, brigade or association;

(f)
a member or former member of the fire department, brigade or association; or

(g)
the legal representatives or heirs of a person referred to in paragraph (f).

